Excited to be in Rio this week to present RETAIN with @zhiyuan_zhou_, @ajwagenmaker, and @KarlPertsch at ICLR 2026 on Saturday from 10:30 AM to 1:00 PM at P3-#1208.

@zhiyuan_zhou_: "Do you ever find finetuning VLA overfits to the target task, to the point where generalist ability is lost and even minor deviations beyond the SFT data break the policy? We found an extremely simple solution: directly merge the base and finetuned policy in weight space." 

The linked project page discusses robust finetuning of vision-language-action robot policies via parameter merging.

